{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>濕疹記得戒口！除了天氣會影響濕疹外，飲食方面也要特別注意，留意中醫師提到的濕疹戒口食物，不想濕疹惡化，就盡量忍口不要吃以下9大濕疹食物，也要改善生活習慣！</p>\n<p>\n濕疹戒口！有濕疹人士要特別注意飲食，留意中醫師提到的濕疹戒口食物，尤其是蝦、蟹和糖這類增加濕熱的食物，不想濕疹惡化，就盡量忍口，不要吃這些濕疹食物啦，仲有注意生活上的小習慣！\n</p>\n<p>Text : Moyin｜Photo : 新傳媒資料室｜營養顧問：何庭軒中醫師</p>\n<h2><strong>9大<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/tag/%E6%BF%95%E7%96%B9/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">濕疹</a>戒口食物</strong></h2>\n<p>俗語有云：禍從口出，但原來也有禍從口入。除了天氣會影響濕疹外，飲食方面也要特別注意，切記濕疹戒口！（備註：文中為參考圖片）</p>\n<h2>1. <a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/tag/%E9%85%92/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">酒精類飲品</a></h2>\n<p>酒為濕熱之物，亦為發物，即富有營養而令某些疾病加重的食物，飲後會增加人體濕熱之性，令濕疹加重。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/wk1_183844392259e87904c363b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"濕疹\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/wk1_183844392259e87904c363b.jpg\" width=\"965\"/></a><figcaption>濕疹要戒口的食物，啤酒類飲品！</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>2. 芋頭</h2>\n<p>芋頭黏滯，古籍中亦明言生吃有毒，即使煮熟，食用後也容易導致滯肚，阻礙脾臟的去濕功能，使人體之濕毒更難消除，助長濕疹。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/wk.2jpg_28623777159e87926a2b74.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"容易導致滯肚的芋頭，也少吃為妙。\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"803\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/wk.2jpg_28623777159e87926a2b74.jpg\" width=\"1200\"/></a><figcaption>容易導致滯肚的芋頭，也少吃為妙。</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>3.糯米</h2>\n<p>糯米性溫，多食令人濕熱，與芋頭一樣，亦是黏滯之物，容易加重人體濕熱之性，除濕疹外，患有口腔或皮膚潰瘍、甲狀腺腫大者亦應避免食用。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/wk4_17271470159e879427e624.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"糯米多食會濕熱，濕疹人士忌吃。\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/wk4_17271470159e879427e624.jpg\" width=\"1200\"/></a><figcaption>糯米多食會濕熱，濕疹人士忌吃。</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>4. 牛奶</h2>\n<p>不少研究已經指出，大部分亞洲人均無法消化牛奶中的主要成分，所以很多人飲用牛奶及奶類製品後會出現消化不良、腹瀉，甚至過敏等不適。大部分濕疹患者皆是過敏體質，故不建議服用牛奶。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/wk5_179141748159e87950f2e0a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"濕疹患者如果是過敏體質，要避免牛奶及奶類製品。\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"393\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/wk5_179141748159e87950f2e0a.jpg\" width=\"236\"/></a><figcaption>濕疹患者如果是過敏體質，要避免牛奶及奶類製品。</figcaption></figure>\n<p> </p>\n<h2>5.<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/tag/%E6%B5%B7%E9%AE%AE/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蝦蟹</a></h2>\n<p>蝦蟹性味極為寒涼，容易損害脾胃功能，除腹痛腹瀉等不適外，亦使脾胃去濕的能力受損，而且海產類食物容易惹濕，故往往使本身症狀加重之餘，亦更難治療。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/wk3_58795769959e8795e42881.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"蝦、蟹極為寒涼，容易損害脾胃去濕的能力，濕疹人士要避免！\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/wk3_58795769959e8795e42881.jpg\" width=\"1200\"/></a><figcaption>蝦、蟹極為寒涼，容易損害脾胃去濕的能力，濕疹人士要避免！</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>6. 高麗參、鹿茸等大補之物</h2>\n<p>不少人也知道濕疹患者屬虛實錯雜的體質，便打算自行進補。其實濕疹患者最忌便是補，即使是中醫師開方，也要非常謹慎。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/wk6_144741874059e8796bbcae8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"濕疹患者最忌便是進補！進食高麗參、鹿茸等補品，建議先詢問醫生。\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/wk6_144741874059e8796bbcae8.jpg\" width=\"1200\"/></a><figcaption>濕疹患者最忌便是進補！進食高麗參、鹿茸等補品，建議先詢問醫生。</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>7.<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/tag/%E6%A6%B4%E6%A7%A4/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">榴槤</a></h2>\n<p>榴槤性溫，且有補火助陽的功效。對於身體有明顯積熱的濕疹患者，榴槤會進一步加重積熱，使濕疹一發不可收拾。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/wk7_182441275859e879968b0cc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"榴槤會進一步加重積熱，濕疹人士戒口！\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/wk7_182441275859e879968b0cc.jpg\" width=\"827\"/></a><figcaption>榴槤會進一步加重積熱，濕疹人士戒口！</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>8. 麵粉製品、<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/tag/%E7%94%9C%E5%93%81/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">甜品</a></h2>\n<p>現代的麵粉製品含有不少添加物，大多亦含有牛奶，對濕疹患者非常不利。如果是自家製作的，也必須注意砂糖量不可太多，因為砂糖、甜品都是濕疹忌吃的，除了會加重濕邪，也容易滯胃。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/wk8_67131253659e879b20782b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"甜品如蛋糕、多糖類製品也要戒口，以防濕疹加劇。\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1068\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/wk8_67131253659e879b20782b.jpg\" width=\"1200\"/></a><figcaption>甜品如蛋糕、多糖類製品也要戒口，以防濕疹加劇。</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>9.辛辣刺激食物</h2>\n<p>不要吃葱、大蒜、生薑、辣椒、花椒等辛辣刺激的食物。耗陰助陽，對濕疹是一種刺激，應該避免食用。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/mg_9957_13076750105d1f45dee5efa_4951062495f7ad8f66686f-1024x683.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"切記少吃辛辣刺激食物！\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/mg_9957_13076750105d1f45dee5efa_4951062495f7ad8f66686f-1024x683.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>切記少吃辛辣刺激食物！</figcaption></figure>\n<p>濕疹戒口係好麻煩，但為了自己的皮膚，也要努力循從！睇埋以下濕疹人士能吃的食物，煲煲湯水，多喝去濕！</p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/?p=588837\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">即睇：10款紓緩濕疹湯水 對抗皮膚痕癢＋滋潤去濕 秋天轉季必睇｜食是食非</a></h2>\n<h2><strong>濕疹的生活迷思</strong></h2>\n<h2><strong>迷思</strong>1：如何從生活習慣上改善濕疹？</h2>\n<p>首先要培養早睡早起，在熟睡中人體有自行修復的能力，所以千萬不要捱夜。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/03_29724411059e89d84831e5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"早睡早起，切忌捱夜。\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"801\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/03_29724411059e89d84831e5.jpg\" width=\"1200\"/></a><figcaption>早睡早起，切忌捱夜。</figcaption></figure>\n<p>避免使用任何含有化學成分或染料的物品。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/6_44472976759e89d89268f4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"少接觸化學品\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/6_44472976759e89d89268f4.jpg\" width=\"800\"/></a><figcaption>少接觸化學品</figcaption></figure>\n<p>濕疹患者應避免浸溫泉、使用公共浴室或游泳池等，免受感染。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/5805_24902327459e89d8c27b84.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"避免浸溫泉或公共泳池。\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/5805_24902327459e89d8c27b84.jpg\" width=\"1200\"/></a><figcaption>避免浸溫泉或公共泳池。</figcaption></figure>\n<p>另外，因為寵物的毛髮是最普遍的致敏原之一，所以並不建議患有各種皮膚病的人士養寵物。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/301_16779296659e87c81a76ec.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"濕疹人士養寵物前要考慮清楚！\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/301_16779296659e87c81a76ec.jpg\" width=\"800\"/></a><figcaption>濕疹人士養寵物前要考慮清楚！</figcaption></figure>\n<h2><strong>迷思2</strong>：有甚麼食療可以改善？</h2>\n<p>多吃蔬菜或飲用蔬菜汁，如檸檬、柑桔、青蘋果等都有清肝去濕的功用。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/6-1_133985603059e89d87b1ad0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"少肉多菜\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"776\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/6-1_133985603059e89d87b1ad0.jpg\" width=\"1200\"/></a><figcaption>少肉多菜</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/03b_214460997959e89d86466eb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"多飲用蔬菜汁，建議選用檸檬、青蘋果，此類水果具清肝功效。\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"780\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/03b_214460997959e89d86466eb.jpg\" width=\"1200\"/></a><figcaption>多飲用蔬菜汁，建議選用檸檬、青蘋果，此類水果具清肝功效。</figcaption></figure>\n<p>另外，紅菜頭或汁生吃最可以清除體內積熱，又能補血養血，清肝護肝，非常適合長期濕疹患者。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/301-1_55334358459e87c8d7100b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"紅菜頭有益！最大功效可以清除體內積熱，濕疹人士多吃有益。\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/301-1_55334358459e87c8d7100b.jpg\" width=\"800\"/></a><figcaption>紅菜頭有益！最大功效可以清除體內積熱，濕疹人士多吃有益。</figcaption></figure>\n<h2><strong>迷思3</strong>：甚麼人易患濕疹？</h2>\n<h2>環境因素</h2>\n<p>香港本處於中國南方，氣候潮濕炎熱，容易引起各種濕熱病患。飲食上，香港人多肉少菜，更經常吃燒烤或煎炸食物，都增加患上濕疹的機會。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/re_001_46791664359e87c9ca2fda.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"飲食上，香港人多肉少菜，更經常吃燒烤或煎炸食物，都增加患上濕疹的機會。\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/re_001_46791664359e87c9ca2fda.jpg\" width=\"799\"/></a><figcaption>飲食上，香港人多肉少菜，更經常吃燒烤或煎炸食物，都增加患上濕疹的機會。</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>家居衛生</h2>\n<p>居住環境潮濕，又不注重家居衛生，則更加容易罹患濕疹。濕疹是最折磨人的疾病之一，外表不討好，自身亦極不舒服，但只要把握飲食法則，注意起居，濕疹一樣可以根治！</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/12_868b_skincare_40701107959e89d8aa3037.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"家居衛生要多留意！\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"801\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/12_868b_skincare_40701107959e89d8aa3037.jpg\" width=\"1200\"/></a><figcaption>家居衛生要多留意！</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/add_photo_1808334259e879f832da4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"何庭軒中醫師＠如意堂 香港中文大學中醫學理學碩士，現為廣州中醫藥大學博士研究生。\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/nhv4dxh3MJN7gxp/add_photo_1808334259e879f832da4.jpg\" width=\"798\"/></a><figcaption><a href=\"https://www.uecmclinic.com/drhoec.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">何庭軒中醫師＠如意堂</a><br/> 香港中文大學中醫學理學碩士，現為廣州中醫藥大學博士研究生。</figcaption></figure>\n<p><a href=\"http://p.nmg.com.hk/abjot7\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"濕疹戒口8大食物！附中醫師食療＋生活習慣Tips｜食是食非\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"721\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/whatsapp-image-2020-09-18-at-15.57.23_6151475495f65c6adb157b.jpeg\" width=\"1280\"/></a></p>\n<p> \n</p>\n<p>香港18區美食有甚麼推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>新假期編輯已經為你整合了香港18區美食指，其中包括尖沙咀、旺角、銅鑼灣等<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/%E5%8D%80%E5%8D%80%E6%90%B5%E9%A3%9F?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%8D%80%E5%8D%80%E6%90%B5%E9%A3%9F\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">……即睇更多詳情。</a></b><br/>\n</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T01:20:49.027939+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1990,"images":20,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T23:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T01:58:33.591448+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T01:18:31.195237+00:00","content_hash":"623211f58710f3fa18dc53d46e2f5db485c6258f810ff6da4e1452b2dfbaabca","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}